# Word of Command (CR 723.2, 723.7, 609.4b, 601.2f): North Star's rule, "for one spell this turn, you may spend mana as though it
# were mana of any type to pay that spell's mana cost", is Bot2's, and reaches the spell Bot2 is made to cast. In response to
# Word of Command Bot2 activates North Star with its four Moxen (none of them red). Lightning Bolt is then chosen: Bot2's only
# mana is its Islands' {U}, which pays the Bolt's {R} under the rule - so Bot2 is able to cast it, and must. Whether it is
# able is judged with the rule's share of the cost, as the priority offers judge it.

